<title>SOUTH KOREA: South Korea's Jan-Feb oil products exports soar.</title>
<headline>South Korea's Jan-Feb oil products exports soar.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's oil products exports surged to 35.4 million barrels in the first two months of 1997 from 19 million barrels in the same period last year, the Ministry of Trade, Industry and Energy said on Friday.</p>
<p>A ministry statement said growth in oil products output and slowdown in domestic demand were behind the export rise.</p>
<p>But the nation's imports dropped sharply to 38.1 million barrels in January-February from 56 million a year ago. The ministry did not give breakdown by each product.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
